.IX Title "SLMSEG 1"
.TH SLMSEG 1 2024-07-13 "perl v5.38.2" "User Contributed Perl Documentation"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH "نام (NAME)"
slmseg \- maximum matching segment Chinese text.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
\&\fBslmseg\fR \-d \fIdict_file\fR [\fIoption\fR]... [\fIcorpus_file\fR]...
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
\&\fBslmseg\fR is a tool for segmenting Chinese text into words using maximum matching algorithm. \fBslmseg\fR segments \fIcorpus_file\fR, or standard input if no filename is specified, and write the segmented result to standard output.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.IX Header "OPTIONS"
.IP "\fB\-d\fR \fIdict_file\fR" 4
.IX Item "-d dict_file"
Use \fIdict_file\fR as lexicon. A default lexicon can be found at \fI/usr/share/sunpinyin\-slm/dict.utf8\fR.
.IP "\fB\-f\fR,\fB\-\-format\fR (\fBtext\fR|\fBbin\fR)" 4
.IX Item "-f,--format (text|bin)"
Output Format, can be 'text' or 'bin'. default 'bin'.
Normally, in text mode, word text are output, while in binary mode,
binary short integer of the word-ids are written to stdout.
.IP "\fB\-s\fR, \fB\-\-stok\fR \fISTOK_ID\fR" 4
.IX Item "-s, --stok STOK_ID"
Sentence token id. Default 10.
It will be written to output in binary mode after every sentence.
.IP "\fB\-i\fR, \fB\-\-show\-id\fR" 4
.IX Item "-i, --show-id"
Show Id info. Under text output format mode, attach id after known words. 
If under binary mode, print id(s) in text.
.IP "\fB\-m\fR, \fB\-\-model\fR \fIlanguage-model-file\fR Specify the language model file. This file is always generated by \fBslmthread\fR." 4
.IX Item "-m, --model language-model-file Specify the language model file. This file is always generated by slmthread."
.SH "نکات (NOTES)"
.IX Header "NOTES"
Under \fBbinary\fR mode, consecutive id of 0 are merged into one 0.
Under \fBtext\fR mode, no space are inserted between unknown-words.
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
.IX Header "AUTHOR"
Originally written by Phill.Zhang <phill.zhang@sun.com>.
Currently maintained by Kov.Chai <tchaikov@gmail.com>.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.IX Header "SEE ALSO"
\&\fBmmseg\fR(1), \fBids2ngram\fR (1).
